  "prefLabel": "Lot 8002.06 Executive officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8002.06 “Executive officer” means an individual, including but not limited to the president, chief executive officer, chairman of the board, partner who is actively involved in management, trustee, or other officer of an organization, who is authorized to submit an application on behalf of the applicant, enter into agreements on the organization’s behalf, or otherwise bind the organization.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
